-### Resizing image
-
-Add HTTP parameters `width` and/or `height` to the link image to resize the image. Values are CSS values (default is `auto`).
-
-```markdown
-![Minion](https://octodex.github.com/images/minion.png?width=20pc)
-```
-
-![Minion](https://octodex.github.com/images/minion.png?width=20pc)
