-```R
-> print("Hello World!")
-```
-{{% /tab %}}
-{{% tab name="Bash" %}}
-```Bash
-echo "Hello World!"
-```
-{{% /tab %}}
-{{< /tabs >}}
-
-Tab views with the same tabs that belong to the same group sychronize their selection:
-
-{{< tabs >}}
-{{% tab name="python" %}}
-```python
-print("Hello World!")
-```
-{{% /tab %}}
-{{% tab name="R" %}}
-```R
-> print("Hello World!")
-```
-{{% /tab %}}
-{{% tab name="Bash" %}}
