-echo "Hello World!"
-```
-{{% /tab %}}
-{{< /tabs >}}
-
-## Config example
-
-	{{</* tabs groupId="config" */>}}
-	{{%/* tab name="json" */%}}
-	```json
-	{
-	  "Hello": "World"
-	}
-	```
-	{{%/* /tab */%}}
-	{{%/* tab name="XML" */%}}
-	```xml
-	<Hello>World</Hello>
-	```
-	{{%/* /tab */%}}
